  title: G O O D   B O Y
  button: GOOD BOY
  riddle: Kibble, a ball, a treat, a sock, two chews, a rope and a bowl. Someone
    is waiting by the door.
  hint: Keep the light low and in front. The bag is the body, the ball the head,
    two chews are legs and the rope wags.
  complete: 'GOOD BOY

    Everything he owns, and the one thing he stole.'
